  "description": "BlazorBridge provides strongly-typed JavaScript interop for Blazor using Roslyn source generators. \nDefine clean C# interfaces annotated with JS metadata, and the generator automatically produces strongly-typed \ninterop wrappers that import modules, invoke JS functions, and deserialize complex return types. \n\nFeatures include:\n• Strongly-typed JS interop without manual IJSRuntime.InvokeAsync calls\n• Zero reflection, compile-time checked proxy generation\n• Support for named and default exports\n• Async and complex return types via System.Text.Json\n• Automatic DI registration method for generated proxies\n• Works in Blazor Server and Blazor WebAssembly",
